B.w1=new A.b3(983737,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.amZ=new A.c5(B.w1,null,B.aq,"Twelve widgets on iPhone","There were none. The widget extension had never been added to the iOS project, so nothing Improvy wrote ever reached a home screen. All twelve are there now: the hourly question, the daily, the key map, your level, the streak, the weakest key and the rest.")
B.an7=new A.c5(B.fd,null,B.aA,"A design, not a dark rectangle","Every widget wears its own accent \u2014 a glow from the top corner and an edge to match \u2014 so a home screen of them reads as separate things. The key map fills each of the twelve tiles by how well you know that key.")
B.vX=new A.b3(983159,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.an4=new A.c5(B.vX,null,B.tP,"The widgets draw the real animal","The level widget showed an emoji where the app draws its own line art. It draws the same animal now, in the level\u2019s colour \u2014 and the empty squares elsewhere are gone: they were characters set in a font that has no glyph for them.")
B.anr=new A.c5(B.py,null,B.aS,"Widget taps arrive somewhere","Chromatic pointed at a setup screen that does not exist, so it opened the app and stopped; Theory landed on the home screen. Both go where they say they go.")
B.vY=new A.b3(983269,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.an9=new A.c5(B.vY,null,B.ai,"Pocket Mode speaks Italian all the way through","The sixth degree and D flat had never been recorded, so an Italian session said those two words in English \u2014 about one question in eight. Both are recorded now.")
B.a09=new A.b3(983571,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ani=new A.c5(B.a09,null,B.aM,"A real app on iPad","Every screen here is drawn for a phone held upright, and an iPad was getting all of it stretched to 1024 points wide. The app now keeps to a centred column of phone width, and stays portrait.")
B.amP=new A.c5(B.lf,null,B.ai,"The last English left over","The widgets speak your language now, and so do the bits the app had missed: the daily challenge rule, the streak in days, the game counts in Statistics.")
B.amV=new A.c5(B.pu,null,B.o9,"Your week, in seven dots","The streak widgets now show the last seven days, not just the count \u2014 and the whole card turns gold on the day you are about to break one.")
B.aaD=s([B.amZ,B.an7,B.an4,B.anr,B.an9,B.ani,B.amP,B.amV],t.d)
B.anH=new A.fj("1.16.0","4 SEP 2026","The home-screen widgets, rebuilt \u2014 and on iPhone, built at all.",B.aaD)
B.a_O=new A.b3(63249,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.amL=new A.c5(B.a_O,null,B.aA,"Three bars, not one average","Each key in Statistics now shows Degree to Note, Note to Degree and \u2026Of What? separately, so a single number can never hide which of the three you have actually built.")
B.a_Z=new A.b3(63679,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.amK=new A.c5(B.a_Z,null,B.ai,"The summary reports what moved","After a session you see the family you just played and the key overall \u2014 and Note to Degree and \u2026Of What? get that card too, now that they keep records of their own.")
B.anp=new A.c5(B.lf,null,B.aM,"One name per mode, in every language","Note to Number, \u2026Of What?, Pocket Mode and the rest keep their names whatever language the app is in. Everything around them still follows your phone.")
B.an6=new A.c5(B.he,null,B.aH,"Pocket Mode says nothing it cannot know","The key tiles no longer carry a mastery bar. Pocket Mode never sees your answer, so it has nothing to measure \u2014 an empty bar was only ever telling you off for nothing.")
B.a0_=new A.b3(983105,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.anh=new A.c5(B.a0_,null,B.aq,"A prettier walkthrough","The three opening screens each have their own colour, and the keyboard on them sits in a rounded bed instead of being cut off at the edges.")
B.a8n=s([B.amL,B.amK,B.anp,B.an6,B.anh],t.d)
B.anx=new A.fj("1.15.0","3 SEP 2026","Every mode you play now counts, and you can see exactly where.",B.a8n)
B.a_S=new A.b3(63357,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.anb=new A.c5(B.a_S,null,B.aq,"A file picker, and only that","Choosing a backup file used the same component that picks photos and videos, so the app looked like it wanted your camera roll. It now opens documents and nothing else.")
B.a7v=s([B.anb],t.d)
B.anw=new A.fj("1.14.1","1 SEP 2026","Restoring a backup no longer asks the phone for more than it needs.",B.a7v)
B.amN=new A.c5(B.j6,null,B.aA,"A keyboard you can move","The numbers sit on the keys. Change the key and watch the letters move while the numbers stay \u2014 that is the whole idea of the app, in one tap.")
B.amO=new A.c5(B.py,null,B.ai,"Answer one before you start","The last screen is a real question, with the key lighting up when you get it. Nobody reaches the home screen without having played.")
B.aaa=s([B.amN,B.amO],t.d)
B.anF=new A.fj("1.14.0","1 SEP 2026","The first three screens now show the idea instead of describing it.",B.aaa)
B.amW=new A.c5(B.lf,null,B.aq,"Italian, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese","The whole app follows your phone\u2019s language. Musicians who write Do Re Mi get that notation from the first screen, and Pocket Mode already speaks Italian.")
B.aa_=s([B.amW],t.d)
B.anJ=new A.fj("1.13.0","1 SEP 2026","Improvy now speaks your language.",B.aa_)
B.a0f=new A.b3(983659,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.and=new A.c5(B.a0f,null,B.aq,"Export and restore","Settings \u2192 Backup writes one file with every key, score and setting. Reinstall, change phone, switch between iPhone and Android \u2014 restore it and everything is back.")
B.a_D=new A.b3(62747,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.anc=new A.c5(B.a_D,null,B.ai,"Larger type, and a screen reader that makes sense","The app now follows the system text size up to 130%, and keys, answer buttons and switches announce what they are.")
B.ad0=s([B.and,B.anc],t.d)
B.anA=new A.fj("1.12.0","31 AUG 2026","Your progress can leave the phone, and the app can be read aloud.",B.ad0)
B.amQ=new A.c5(B.e7,null,B.aq,"Every right answer sounds","Name the \u266d3 of A and you hear it. The ear learns alongside the number \u2014 switch it off in Settings for quiet places.")
B.anl=new A.c5(B.px,null,B.aA,"What a degree is, before the first question","Three short screens after the welcome: the numbers, why they work in every key, and what the game asks. Skippable if you already know.")
B.a_P=new A.b3(63282,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ano=new A.c5(B.a_P,null,B.ai,"The summary tells the truth",'"Level passed" now means the next tier is actually open \u2014 the same 80% bar the rest of the app uses \u2014 and a free player who finishes a key is shown the half they have not seen.')
B.a3K=s([B.amQ,B.anl,B.ano],t.d)
B.anM=new A.fj("1.11.0","31 AUG 2026","Hear the note you just named, and a proper start for newcomers.",B.a3K)
B.a_V=new A.b3(63480,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.anj=new A.c5(B.a_V,null,B.ai,"A bar under every key","Pick a key in Note to Number or \u2026Of What? and each one carries a small bar: filled as far as you have taken it, empty for the rest. Twelve keys read like twelve columns, and the one you select says its exact figure at the top.")
B.a5C=s([B.anj],t.d)
B.anD=new A.fj("1.10.5","30 AUG 2026","Every key shows how far you have taken it, at a glance.",B.a5C)
B.amS=new A.c5(B.vQ,null,B.cs,"The key ranking means something","It ranked by raw accuracy over all history, which rewarded not climbing: a key dabbled with at six seconds outranked one taken to Master. It now ranks how often you answer right inside 1.2 seconds \u2014 either you know where the \u266d3 is or you are counting.")
B.a06=new A.b3(983477,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ang=new A.c5(B.a06,null,B.aq,"Response time, not accuracy over time","Accuracy fell off a cliff the day you unlocked a harder tier, so the chart showed a decline for what was clearly progress. Speed has no such reversal \u2014 it only ever falls as you get better.")
B.a_Q=new A.b3(63317,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.amM=new A.c5(B.a_Q,null,B.iy,"Each card reads the modes it is about","Degree Accuracy takes both directions over a key and leaves the harmonizer out. The keyboard heatmap takes everything, but one reading per session, so a long evening cannot drown a short one.")
B.ad2=s([B.amS,B.ang,B.amM],t.d)
B.anv=new A.fj("1.10.2","30 AUG 2026","The statistics now measure what you would feel on a bandstand.",B.ad2)
B.anu=new A.c5(B.vX,null,B.bf,"Turtle is two sessions away","The eight levels used to be eight equal steps, set when a key counted one skill. The first ones are now close together and the last ones are a long climb \u2014 which is what their names always promised.")
B.a0h=new A.b3(983776,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.anm=new A.c5(B.a0h,null,B.aA,"The two directions carry more weight","Reading a degree and naming the note, and its mirror, are 40% of a key each. Naming the key a note belongs to is rarer and more advanced, and is the remaining 20%.")
B.abN=s([B.anu,B.anm],t.d)
B.anB=new A.fj("1.10.1","30 AUG 2026","The animals come faster now, and the harder ones cost more.",B.abN)
B.a0i=new A.b3(984592,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.amU=new A.c5(B.a0i,null,B.aA,"Three skills, one number","Naming the note for a degree, naming the degree for a note, and naming the key a note belongs to. Each is a third of what it means to know a key, and the tile shows the three together.")
B.a0e=new A.b3(983651,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.an3=new A.c5(B.a0e,null,B.aH,"Your percentages will look smaller","Nothing was lost and nothing was reset. The scale got three times longer, so a key you had finished now reads 33% \u2014 and open it to see exactly which two thirds are left.")
B.ank=new A.c5(B.vT,null,B.ai,"Every key explains itself","Key Analysis breaks the number into its three parts instead of the two it used to show, so the figure on the tile is never a black box.")
B.a5q=s([B.amU,B.an3,B.ank],t.d)
B.any=new A.fj("1.10.0","30 AUG 2026","A key is now scored on all three ways of knowing it \u2014 so most of them just got a lot bigger.",B.a5q)
B.a07=new A.b3(983499,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ann=new A.c5(B.a07,null,B.ai,"One rule, three modes","Note to Number and \u2026Of What? are now scored like the main modes: half the score is knowing the core cold \u2014 the seven scale degrees, or the chord tones \u2014 and half is extending it to every degree.")
B.an5=new A.c5(null,"\u266f\u266d",B.aq,"Chord and All keep their own records","\u2026Of What? used to pool both into one bar, so a run on the four chord tones filled the same dial as a run on all fifteen degrees. They are separate now, and your old scores stay where they belong.")
B.a2r=s([B.ann,B.an5],t.d)
B.anL=new A.fj("1.9.4","30 AUG 2026","Every mode is scored the same way now, and half of each one is free.",B.a2r)
B.a_F=new A.b3(62973,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ana=new A.c5(B.a_F,null,B.aA,"A number that adds up","Chromatic contains the seven notes of the scale, and Master asks the same questions as Apprentice with less time. Your key percentage now takes both into account, so a hard run counts for the easier ones you never needed to play.")
B.an_=new A.c5(B.vV,null,B.ai,"One bar to clear, and it is lower","Every tier now opens at 80% of the one below it \u2014 it used to be 90% for Virtuoso and 92.5% for Master, two different bars. And a key you have already proved opens its tiers straight away.")
B.anf=new A.c5(B.hg,null,B.aH,"Some keys just went up","Nothing you have done was lost \u2014 it was being counted wrongly. Nobody goes down, and a few keys jump a long way.")
B.acL=s([B.ana,B.an_,B.anf],t.d)
B.anz=new A.fj("1.9.3","30 AUG 2026","The percentage on a key finally counts everything you have already proved.",B.acL)
B.a_N=new A.b3(63189,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.an2=new A.c5(B.a_N,null,B.ai,"Every key shows its own progress","The outline of each key fills as you take it through the three tiers, in that key\u2019s own colour. Twelve keys, read at a glance.")
B.a08=new A.b3(983501,"MaterialIcons",!1)
